        253.23556209150328,
        563.8128071338384,
        663.3681421568627,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "Figure 12-43 on page 638. For each key server, enter the name, IP address and TCP port ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.23556209150328,
        579.342877209596,
        663.2564138071895,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "for KMIP protocol (default value is 5696). Note that server name is only a label, so it does ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.23559558823527,
        594.8729343434344,
        352.7726589052288,
        11.92337720959597
      ],
      "text": "not need to be the real host name of the server.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.23559558823527,
        616.9254210858587,
        613.047056781046,
        11.923377209595913
      ],
      "text": "Although Gemalto SafeNet KeySecure uses an active-active clustered model, IBM ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.23559558823527,
        632.4554911616162,
        663.1679489379086,
        11.923364267676675
      ],
      "text": "Spectrum Virtualize asks for a primary key server. The primary key server represents only ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.23559558823527,
        647.9855612373738,
        659.7966033496732,
        11.923364267676732
      ],
      "text": "the KeySecure server that is used for key create and rekey operations. Therefore, any of ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.23559558823527,
        663.5156183712121,
        423.24969934640535,
        11.92337720959597
      ],
      "text": "the clustered key servers can be selected as the primary.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.23559558823527,
        685.4907383207071,
        663.1462765522876,
        11.923403093434388
      ],
      "text": "Selecting a primary key server is beneficial for load balancing. Any four key servers can be ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
